
@startuml HealthResearchArchitecture
title Sleep Health Research - Overall Architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Research Analyst" as User

package "Presentation Layer" {
  component "Streamlit Frontend" as UI
}

package "Orchestration Layer - LangGraph" {
  component "Planner / Router\nselect()" as Router
  component "Scope Reply" as Scope
}

package "Worker Layer" {
  component "Research Worker\nresearch()" as Research
  component "Reflective Worker\nreflect()" as Reflect
}

package "Retrieval Layer" {
  component "LangChain Retrieval Tool\nretrieve_sleep_evidence()" as RAG
  database "In-memory ChromaDB\ncdc_sleep_v1" as DB
}

cloud "CDC About Sleep\nSource Reference" as CDC

User --> UI : General sleep question
UI --> Router : Invoke workflow
Router --> Scope : Out-of-scope request
Router --> Research : In-scope request
Research --> RAG : Query
RAG --> DB : Binary-vector search
DB --> RAG : Ranked passages
RAG --> Research : Evidence + IDs
Research --> Reflect : Draft + evidence
Reflect --> Router : Reviewed result
Router --> UI : Final response
Scope --> UI : Scope response
DB ..> CDC : Source attribution

note right of Router
  Deterministic keyword and
  personal-advice scope rules.
  No LLM invocation.
end note

note right of DB
  Four curated paraphrases.
  Ephemeral collection.
  No pretrained embeddings.
end note

@enduml
